    "detailed_description": "Fight through bloodstained battlefields of intense swordplay action. Explore the historic Japanese capital of Edo-era Kyoto, twisted by malevolent clouds of Malice.<br />\r\nWith every stage cloaked in mystery, danger and intrigue. Battle against monstrosities from the underworld known as Genma in a tale of dark fantasy.<br />\r\nFollow the tale of a samurai who wields the Oni Gauntlet, a mystical artifact that grants its bearer the power to slay Genma.<br />\r\nThrough gritty, blood-soaked brawls, he searches for his reason to fight. What fate awaits at the end of his path?",
    "about_the_game": "Fight through bloodstained battlefields of intense swordplay action. Explore the historic Japanese capital of Edo-era Kyoto, twisted by malevolent clouds of Malice.<br />\r\nWith every stage cloaked in mystery, danger and intrigue. Battle against monstrosities from the underworld known as Genma in a tale of dark fantasy.<br />\r\nFollow the tale of a samurai who wields the Oni Gauntlet, a mystical artifact that grants its bearer the power to slay Genma.<br />\r\nThrough gritty, blood-soaked brawls, he searches for his reason to fight. What fate awaits at the end of his path?",
